message: "If this hardware repository contributes to your research, please cite the repository and identify the hardware board revisions used."
type: software
title: "Autonomous-Photonics-Carrier"
authors:
  - family-names: "Arslan"
    given-names: "Taylan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/manyetox/Autonomous-Photonics-Carrier"
abstract: >-
  Source-available modular mobile carrier hardware for research into autonomous
  and reconfigurable free-space photonics experiments. The repository contains
  KiCad hardware sources, fabrication outputs, preliminary firmware, versioned
  sub-board documentation, and validation/reproducibility notes.
keywords:
  - photonics
  - robotics
  - autonomous experiments
  - embedded systems
  - optical flow
  - sensor fusion
